<list candidate commands/classes, not implemented here>

## Codex-pack requirements
<list needed SPEC/RUN_INSTRUCTIONS/CODEX_PROMPT contents if Codex required>

## Safety statement
CIP05 produced a plan only and performed no config/public/DOT/evidence/live mutation.", color="#00695C", fillcolor="#E0F2F1"];
